  Experimental features
  Checked features are configured on. Some experimental features take effect
  only in new tasks or after restarting the Codex server.


› [ ] Background process notifications  Background commands can notify the model
                                        when they exit or print a matching line,
                                        so it does not poll them; codex exec
                                        waits for these notifications before it
                                        exits.


  space toggle · enter save · esc save/close
